  <title>Product location</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>General</gui><gui>Product location</gui></guiseq> lists
  where each product is kept at one location: its aisle, rack, cart, shelf,
  cabinet, drawer and bin. Choose the location in the box beside
  <gui>Location</gui>.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>Type into the search boxes above the columns to narrow the list:
    the product name, or any part of the place, such as every product in aisle
    3. The button beside them clears every search box.</p></item>
    <item><p>Double click a product to open it in <link xref="products"/>, where
    <gui>Product location</gui> changes where it is kept.</p></item>
    <item><p>Right click a product for its <gui>Product hub</gui>.</p></item>
  </list>

  <p>When a location is changed elsewhere, <gui>Refresh</gui> appears; click
  it to reload the list.</p>

</page>
